WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.384 --> 00:00:14.211
The two stared at Curious Ear.

2
00:00:14.231 --> 00:00:17.272
"I'm the real Wukong!"

3
00:00:17.472 --> 00:00:18.433
shouted one monkey.

4
00:00:18.453 --> 00:00:21.554
"Right?" "No, it's me!"

5
00:00:21.835 --> 00:00:22.915
shouted the other monkey.

6
00:00:22.935 --> 00:00:28.658
"I know which of you is the fake Sun Wukong," said Curious Ear.

7
00:00:28.678 --> 00:00:31.780
"But I won't say who it is.

8
00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:37.640
The fake Sun Wukong has all the same powers as the real one.

9
00:00:39.161 --> 00:00:41.824
I point him out, he'll be angry.

10
00:00:41.844 --> 00:00:44.486
He could destroy the entire palace."

11
00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:47.629
"It's true," said one Wukong.

12
00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:51.152
"I could destroy this whole palace if I wanted to."

13
00:00:51.172 --> 00:00:55.616
"You mean, I could destroy it," said the other Wukong.

14
00:00:55.636 --> 00:00:57.778
"No!" yelled the other.

15
00:00:57.798 --> 00:00:58.899
"I could!"

16
00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:04.374
The two Wukongs began swinging their iron bars at each other.

17
00:01:04.394 --> 00:01:08.436
"Please stop!"

18
00:01:08.716 --> 00:01:09.857
cried the Judge of the Dead.

19
00:01:09.877 --> 00:01:12.799
"You'll tear this whole palace down!"

20
00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:15.300
The monkeys stopped.

21
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:21.163
"Buddha can help you," said Curious Ear.

22
00:01:21.183 --> 00:01:25.186
"He'll be able to see which of you is the real Wukong.

23
00:01:25.846 --> 00:01:29.188
And he's powerful enough to destroy the fake one."

24
00:01:30.324 --> 00:01:31.104
"Of course!"

25
00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.525
cried one Wukong.

26
00:01:32.545 --> 00:01:34.225
"We'll go see Buddha!"

27
00:01:36.066 --> 00:01:38.726
um, sure," said the other Wukong.

28
00:01:39.627 --> 00:01:40.427
He looked worried.

29
00:01:41.187 --> 00:01:41.807
"You're nervous!"

30
00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.308
said the first Wukong.

31
00:01:43.328 --> 00:01:47.329
"That's because you know Buddha is going to see who you really are."

32
00:01:49.269 --> 00:01:50.530
shouted the other Wukong.

33
00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:53.831
He swung his iron bar furiously.

34
00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:57.892
out!" cried the Judge of the Dead.

35
00:01:58.576 --> 00:02:00.797
"Take your fight somewhere else!"

36
00:02:03.997 --> 00:02:06.578
The two Wukongs left the Land of Darkness.

37
00:02:07.918 --> 00:02:13.500
Clouds swirled and thunder boomed as the two mighty spirits battled across the sky.

38
00:02:15.821 --> 00:02:18.281
They soon arrived in the Western Paradise.

39
00:02:19.442 --> 00:02:22.402
A guard rushed out of the Thunderclap Monastery.

40
00:02:23.883 --> 00:02:24.883
fighting immediately!"

41
00:02:25.183 --> 00:02:26.143
he called up to them.

42
00:02:26.163 --> 00:02:29.516
"Tell me who you are!"

43
00:02:29.636 --> 00:02:31.677
The two Wukongs landed in front of the guard.

44
00:02:33.317 --> 00:02:34.678
guard looked surprised.

45
00:02:34.698 --> 00:02:36.718
"Wukong?" he said.

46
00:02:36.738 --> 00:02:38.619
"There are two of you!"

47
00:02:40.539 --> 00:02:41.800
said one of the Wukongs.

48
00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.581
"I must speak with Buddha right away."

49
00:02:45.381 --> 00:02:47.301
The other Wukong scratched his head.

50
00:02:47.321 --> 00:02:51.143
"If Buddha is busy, we can just come back another time."

51
00:02:52.163 --> 00:02:54.223
first Wukong shot a look at the other.

52
00:02:54.243 --> 00:02:59.716
"No, we can't."

53
00:02:59.836 --> 00:03:01.338
"You may enter," said the guard.

54
00:03:01.358 --> 00:03:04.601
"But you must behave yourselves while inside."

55
00:03:05.722 --> 00:03:10.046
As the first Wukong started to enter the monastery, the other one backed away.

56
00:03:10.066 --> 00:03:13.489
"You're coming with me!"

57
00:03:13.809 --> 00:03:15.011
said the first Wukong.

58
00:03:16.052 --> 00:03:20.015
He grabbed the other monkey by the arm and dragged him into the monastery.

59
00:03:22.057 --> 00:03:24.820
In front of Buddha, the first Wukong bowed.

60
00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:29.784
The other Wukong hesitated a moment and then bowed also.

61
00:03:31.225 --> 00:03:33.047
Buddha," said the first Wukong.

62
00:03:33.067 --> 00:03:36.630
"I must ask for your help."

63
00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.254
"I know why you're here, Wukong," said Buddha.

64
00:03:41.194 --> 00:03:42.296
looked at the other monkey.

65
00:03:42.316 --> 00:03:46.379
"And I know that are a fake."

66
00:03:48.301 --> 00:03:50.944
The other Wukong gasped and then vanished.

67
00:03:51.972 --> 00:03:56.794
Buddha held a bowl up in the air and then placed it upside down on a table.

68
00:03:56.814 --> 00:04:02.457
"I've trapped the fake Wukong under this bowl," said Buddha.

69
00:04:03.317 --> 00:04:07.259
When Buddha lifted the bowl, a tiny monkey spirit lay on the table.

70
00:04:08.219 --> 00:04:10.340
Wukong leaned closer to see.

71
00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:14.902
"He was a monkey who became an evil spirit," said Buddha.

72
00:04:14.922 --> 00:04:18.884
"He wanted to be you because you're so powerful."

73
00:04:20.485 --> 00:04:24.749
laughed. "Many spirits want to be me."

74
00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.714
The monkey thanked Buddha and then flew back to Mount Potalaka.

75
00:04:32.817 --> 00:04:37.141
Guanyin decided it was time for Wukong to rejoin his companions on the journey.

76
00:04:39.203 --> 00:04:43.488
She and the monkey found the Tang Monk and the others along the road to the west.

77
00:04:45.856 --> 00:04:50.300
The bodhisattva told the Tang Monk that it wasn't Wukong who'd attacked him.

78
00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:55.025
"You must keep Wukong with you," explained Guanyin.

79
00:04:55.045 --> 00:04:58.988
"Yes, Bodhisattva," said the Tang Monk, bowing.

80
00:04:59.008 --> 00:05:03.092
"Thank you, Bodhisattva," said Wukong.

81
00:05:03.112 --> 00:05:07.196
"I'll make sure the Tang Monk reaches the Western Paradise!"
